sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant F as Forge core
  participant S as Source harness
  participant J as Durable journal
  participant T as Target harness
  U->>F: Continue work through another harness
  F->>T: Verify capabilities and workspace access
  T-->>F: Supported scope or unavailable
  F->>S: Stop new dispatch and reach safe boundary
  S-->>F: Stop evidence and artifact checkpoint
  F->>F: Verify source stopped or effects fenced
  F->>J: Persist hashes, uncertainties, receipts
  alt Unsettled effect or incomplete checkpoint
    F-->>U: Hold for reconciliation; keep target inactive
  else Verified checkpoint and safe authority transfer
    F->>J: Commit successor generation and binding
    F->>F: Invalidate old native approval identities
    F->>T: Scoped context and artifact references
    T->>T: Revalidate acceptance criteria
    T-->>F: Progress, artifacts, usage, receipts
    F->>J: Record and verify progress
    F-->>U: Same work record, new execution attempt
  end
